Patchlevel 3 will be released a couple of days after Labor Day
(on the 6th or 7th of the month).

Again, we want to thank all of you who mailed us or posted bug
fixes and suggestions.  Many, but not all, of your suggestions
were incorporated.  A few were rejected, and some are still
pending.  

The delay in implementing some of your ideas may be explained by
the fact that our main concern remains making the game bug-free, 
efficient, and portable.  Until this is done, all kinds of grand 
ideas (some yours) are kept on ice.

-Izchak


